WEBVTT

00:03:28.448 --> 00:03:32.171
However, even recycling companies 
need our scrutiny.

00:03:32.171 --> 00:03:34.221
Just as the production of smartphones

00:03:34.221 --> 00:03:36.816
comes with social 
and environmental problems,

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:39.085
dismantling them does too.

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:42.554
E-waste is sometimes intentionally 
exported to countries

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:45.980
where labor is cheap 
but working conditions are poor.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:49.448
Vast workforces, 
often made up of women and children,

00:03:49.448 --> 00:03:50.809
may be underpaid,

00:03:50.809 --> 00:03:53.528
lack the training 
to safely disassemble phones,

00:03:53.528 --> 00:03:56.556
and be exposed to elements 
like lead and mercury,

00:03:56.556 --> 00:03:59.692
which can permanently damage 
their nervous systems.

00:03:59.692 --> 00:04:02.373
Phone waste can also end up 
in huge dump sites,